ely snap away half of all  life across the entire universe five  years after that OSes fateful decimation  the Avengers reunited an endgame to  attempt a time heist in hopes of saving  all of their vanquished friends and  loved ones despite several mishaps it  ended up working out but one surprise  guest returned along with everyone else  who was originally dusted when Thanos  shot his army from 2014 into the MC use  present Gamora was suddenly back in play  with a big catch this wasn't the version  of Gamora that died in infinity war  rather it was the 2014 Gamora who was  still firmly on her dad's side  for this reason fans debated whether or  not Gamora was spared during Tony  Stark's sacrificial snap during end  games big battle scene even though it  was possible that Tony snapped didn't  dust her and that she was still around  somewhere Gamora didn't show up on  star-lords radar when he went searching  for her in the final moments of endgame  the argument was still raging in May of  2019 when the creative team behind  Avengers end game simply stoked the  flames by saying that gamora's fate  could go either way during a chat with  Business Insider the Russo said that  Gamora may have been dusted but it was  also possible that she survived the snap  they then stated that fans would just  have to wait until guardians of the  galaxy vol 3 arrives and theaters to see  for themselves to make matters more  stressful the Russos also said that  quill who is looking for Gamora at the  end of endgame didn't know what had  happened to her either at that time the  Russo brothers seemed happy to put the  burden of this particular reveal on  James Gunn who is returning as the  writer and director of the third  guardians movie but thankfully they've  changed their tune and revealed the  truth ahead of schedule however now that  we know for sure that Gamora is alive  there are still some obvious  complications since she's the 2014  Gamora she doesn't know anything about  the Avengers and  doesn't really know who Peter quill even  is which could present some pretty  awkward problems  she and her sister nebula could also  still potentially be at odds despite the  friendship they forged throughout their  previous adventures together  Saldana hasn't officially confirmed her  return in Guardians three but she did  recently say that she would love to play  a more villainous version of her  signature Marvel character in the  upcoming sequel so it stands to reason  that Gamora would be included in the  final film of this whimsical irreverent  film trilogy and since she was also one  of the stars who petitioned to reinstate  Gunn after old tweets initially got him  fired from the third guardians film the  idea of Gunn not being behind the camera  is no longer standing in the way of her  returning for now it remains to be seen  just what type of role Gamora will play  in the upcoming Marvel films but at the  very least it's comforting to know that  the MCS favorite verdant warrior is  still out there somewhere planning her  next move check out one of our newest  videos right here plus even more looper  videos about the MCU are coming soon  subscribe to our YouTube channel and hit  the belt so you don't miss a single one  [Music]
 

